<title>FRANCE: Euro Disney Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Euro Disney Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					1,132    vs    1,005</p>
<p>NOTE  - Euro Disney SCA gave the figure in the BALO official bulletin. The company is 39 percent owned by The Walt Disney Co.</p>
